{"unit_id":"musclePatrickStar__fdtree#card-zh","repo":"musclePatrickStar/fdtree","commit":"2db07d2f019af48fb472e793bb1ada0e422fc734","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"fdtree 是面向 DSH Web 的工作区文件浏览与差异查看插件。它通过客户端侧栏入口打开嵌入式文件面板，并由宿主端提供目录、文件和差异数据。用户可以展开工作区目录、在多个标签中查看文件，并以红绿行标记对照 Git HEAD 或会话基线；无 Git 仓库时还能为当前文件设置基线。右键目录项可在宿主系统对应位置打开终端。适合需要在 DSH Web 会话中快速浏览项目文件和检查改动的开发者；无需 API 密钥，终端功能依赖宿主系统可用的终端环境。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:356-430","lib/index.js:469-595","client/client.js:795-827"]}
{"unit_id":"musclePatrickStar__fdtree#card-en","repo":"musclePatrickStar/fdtree","commit":"2db07d2f019af48fb472e793bb1ada0e422fc734","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"fdtree adds a workspace file tree and diff panel to DSH Web. Browse folders, open files in tabs, and compare edits with Git HEAD or a session baseline. Without Git, set a baseline for a file. A context menu can open a host terminal at a selected folder. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:356-430","lib/index.js:469-595","client/client.js:795-827"]}
