{"unit_id":"musclePatrickStar__fdtree#feature-1","repo":"musclePatrickStar/fdtree","commit":"2db07d2f019af48fb472e793bb1ada0e422fc734","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"fdtree 的功能「工作区文件树」：在 DSH Web 面板中展开目录并列出文件。点击文件会打开内容视图，可保留多个文件标签并切换查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:382-410","client/client.js:520-565"]}
{"unit_id":"musclePatrickStar__fdtree#feature-2","repo":"musclePatrickStar/fdtree","commit":"2db07d2f019af48fb472e793bb1ada0e422fc734","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"fdtree 的功能「实时差异查看」：打开文件后显示 Git HEAD 差异，未处于 Git 仓库时则与会话基线比较，并以新增、删除行及数量呈现。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:469-503","client/client.js:735-780"]}
{"unit_id":"musclePatrickStar__fdtree#feature-3","repo":"musclePatrickStar/fdtree","commit":"2db07d2f019af48fb472e793bb1ada0e422fc734","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"fdtree 的功能「自定义比较基线」：在非 Git 模式打开文件后，可通过内容栏的设基线操作保存当前文本快照，后续差异会与该快照比较。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:448-455","client/client.js:575-585"]}
{"unit_id":"musclePatrickStar__fdtree#feature-4","repo":"musclePatrickStar/fdtree","commit":"2db07d2f019af48fb472e793bb1ada0e422fc734","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"fdtree 的功能「从文件树打开终端」：右键目录或文件可选择打开终端；选择文件时定位到其所在目录，选择目录时进入该目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:506-552","client/client.js:570-610"]}
{"unit_id":"musclePatrickStar__fdtree#caveat-1","repo":"musclePatrickStar/fdtree","commit":"2db07d2f019af48fb472e793bb1ada0e422fc734","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"fdtree 在 Linux 宿主机上打开终端需要 DISPLAY 或 WAYLAND_DISPLAY 图形环境；未检测到时该操作会返回无法打开终端的提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:527-532"]}
